# K't'inga-Class Battle Cruiser: "Whenever this Spacecraft enters or attacks, one or two target Klingons and/or Warriors you
# control gain flying until end of turn" (CR 603.4, 611.2a) - entering with Defense Force Aggressor the only legal target the
# engine takes it; on the first attack both of the two are chosen, on the second only one, and on the third three are refused
# because the slot takes one or two (CR 601.2c). A creature that is no Klingon or Warrior (Grizzly Bears, and the Spacecraft
# itself) and the opponent's own Klingon are refused and never gain flying. The flying ends at cleanup (CR 514.2), so nothing
# has it on Bot2's turns. The 4+ striation (CR 721.2a-b) makes the Spacecraft a 5/5 artifact creature with flying at four charge
# counters, which is what lets it attack at all.

